.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
*.log

# Playwright MCP scratch (visual verification of the report + panel)
.playwright-mcp/

# audit plugin runtime artifacts (this repo dogfoods its own manifest)
docs/audit/*.lock
docs/audit/audit-report.html
docs/audit/audit-report.md

# Token-usage ledger. Local by default: it records counts, model ids, timestamps,
# branch and author - never prompt content - but it is per-developer telemetry and
# most repos will not want it in history. To share it across a team instead, delete
# this line and add `*.jsonl merge=union` to .gitattributes: the ledger is
# append-only NDJSON, so a union merge resolves concurrent appends cleanly, and the
# `author` on every row is what makes cross-developer analytics work.
.claude/usage/
